    {
      "id": "lake-arrival-p2",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": {
        "zhHans": [
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "text": "最醒目的线索是钓鱼设备。与 Seasons 反复回访同一房间的结构不同，The Lake 把注意力集中到木屋与水面之间：室内发现会推动你再次面对湖。"
          }
        ],
        "en": [
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "text": "Fishing gear is the clearest invitation. Unlike Seasons, which repeatedly revisits the same room across time, The Lake concentrates attention on the exchange between cabin and water: discoveries indoors keep sending you back toward the lake."
          }
        ]
      },
      "spoiler": {
        "level": "minor",
        "requiredCompletedGameIds": [],
        "allowManualReveal": true
      },
      "provenance": {
        "mode": "editorial-summary",
        "sourceIds": [
          "official-the-lake-page",
          "editorial-rla"
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "lake-arrival-p3",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": {
        "zhHans": [
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "text": "官方推荐游玩顺序把 The Lake 放在 Seasons 之后，但这只是推荐体验顺序，并不等于故事发生年份。档案因此保留“无日期”状态。"
          }
        ],
        "en": [
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "text": "The official recommended play order places The Lake after Seasons, but that is a suggested experience order—not an in-universe date. This archive therefore keeps the chapter undated."
          }
        ]
      },
      "spoiler": {
        "level": "none",
